module Laws
    intent =
        "The second proof entry: every law-carrying module outside the Script"
        "engine's cone, gathered under one root so aver proof can export them"
        "together and CI can ratchet them (n1bor/btc-listener#349)."
        "The CI proof job exports domain/interp.av, which reaches the engine"
        "and nothing else; Chainwork's three laws sat outside it from the day"
        "they were written, gated by nothing but aver verify, and every law"
        "over the chain, the stores and the codecs would have too. This module"
        "depends on those modules and defines nothing: nothing depends on it,"
        "so it cannot make a cycle, and it exposes nothing, so nothing is"
        "unused. Its one function is here because a module needs one to be a"
        "program, and it says which modules the entry gathers."
        "aver proof main.av would be the whole program and panics on a"
        "capability resource inside a sum type (n1bor/btc-listener#350); this"
        "leaf sidesteps that by reaching no infra module."
    exposes [gathered]
    depends [Domain.Block, Domain.Chainwork, Domain.Segment, Domain.Subsidy, Domain.Target, Domain.HeaderTree, Domain.Watchdog, Domain.UtxoStore]
    effects []

fn gathered() -> Int
    ? "How many law-carrying modules this entry gathers: the depends list above."
    8

verify gathered
    gathered() => 8
